{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>It is the sin-offering of the congregation.</b> For this cannot occur unless the sin of the generation is also involved. Yet Scripture writes of them וְאָשְׁמוּ (\"and they shall bear their guilt\") in order to admonish them to repentance before they offer the sacrifice. And their sin-offering too is burned, and because of the severity of the sin of both, their blood is brought inside the sanctuary."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 4, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:35:43.870311427Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}